    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пожалуйста, поговори с папой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please talk to dad.' Still worried about Nastya's father, Max begs her again to clear things up with her dad.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я постараюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will try.' Nastya promises she will try to talk to him when the time is right.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А что это такое?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what is this?' Changing the subject, Max spots an elaborate dish on the counter and asks what it is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "valya",
      "t": "Это мой десерт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is my dessert.' The kitchen helper proudly explains that it is his own dessert creation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Прямо как у шефа.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just like the Chef's.' Max is amazed and says it looks just like something Chef Barinov would plate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "valya",
      "t": "Спасибо большое.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much.' Beaming with pride, Valya thanks him warmly for the praise.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Можно попробовать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can I taste it?' Curious to see if it tastes as good as it looks, Max asks if he can try a bite.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "valya",
      "t": "Конечно, бери.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course, take it.' Valya gladly invites him to go ahead and taste it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Это очень вкусно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is very tasty.' After one bite, Max declares the dessert genuinely delicious.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Да, мне тоже нравится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I like it too.' Tasting it too, Nastya agrees that she really likes it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "valya",
      "t": "Я долго учился этому.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I studied this for a long time.' Valya explains that he practiced for a long time to master the recipe.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ты молодец, Валя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well done, Valya.' Max pats him on the back and tells him he did a great job.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Шеф будет рад.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
